The Wyrmtide Rises
The fractured remnants of the once-mighty Garou Nation are under
siege, beset by enemies from every corner. From the insidious corporate
machinations of Pentex and its ilk to the malevolence of Banes, fomori, and
other possessed hosts, the Garou face an overwhelming tide of monstrosities.
Standing as Gaia’s last line of defense, the Garou struggle against forces
determined to desecrate her sacred, dying soil — even as the spirits of the
Weaver and the Wyld sometimes turn against them.
Discover how the Garou continue the fight when their best weapons fall
short. Engage with dozens of adversaries and rivals to expand your chronicles.
Choose your battlefields, Advantages, Gifts, and Loresheets with care — your
enemies have never been more numerous or more dangerous. Wyrmtide offers
a wealth of adversaries, tactics, powers, and narrative depth for players and
Storytellers to elevate any chronicle.
