• 6 additional Weaver and Wyld servants as rivals or enemies
• 8 distinct battlefields to fight your enemies in
• 2 sample stories to play through or adapt to your chronicle
• 10 New Advantages and Flaws, 8 Wyrm-tainted Gifts, and 3 Loresheets
• New adversary powers to make each one unique
