WYRMTIDE Loresheets
Loresheets in Werewolf connect the players’ characters to essential elements of the
setting. That holds true even when we’re talking about things held tight in the coils of the
Wyrm. These three Loresheets might mark a character as suspicious in the eyes of other
Garou, but they may also grant crucial advantages in the war against the Destroyer. Any given
character’s relationship to the subject of a Loresheet may be positive, negative, neutral, or mixed.
Storytellers and players should work together to find the best way to incorporate the Loresheet
into a chronicle.
