Eviscerators
Black Spiral Dancer theurges believe Eviscerators were
birthed from the very first time a throat was cut. Now
they are legion, seeking new targets to disembowel.
Eviscerators search for people considering the act
of murder and drive them towards it. Then, they
encourage them to keep at it, finding gorier and
crueler ways to end something’s life.
What Does It Want? Eviscerators spill both the
mystical blood of the spirits and the physical blood
of living creatures. These Banes want to know how
many lacerations a victim can stand before dying,
or how far someone’s heart can be ripped out of
their chest until it snaps away from their arteries and
veins. When they kill, it’s never clean.
