attacks the target’s Willpower instead of Health.
It uses Persuasion and causes +2 Aggravated
Willpower damage.
The Mirror Trap: When the Oubliette reduces
a target’s Willpower to 0, they are automatically
abducted into a liminal space in the Gauntlet,
where the target is slowly made to submit to a desire
for pure entropy. Each day, the Oubliette subjects
its prisoners to visions of meaningless solitude
until they break, inflicting a level of harano. Once
harano is at maximum, the Oubliette releases its
victim. If the Oubliette is destroyed in the Umbra,
trapped victims are released.
