late stages of the Wyrm’s imprisonment as freedom
seemed eternally beyond reach. Why work for such
an uncaring, ungrateful, meaningless world?
Lethargg grows when meaning fades and purpose
grows dim. It thrives in depression, whispering that
the blackest thoughts are the most true. The world
cannot be changed and all effort is futile. For the
Black Spiral Dancers, Lethargg is something of a
problem Urge, as giving in sabotages the plans of all
