Mahsstrac, Urge of Power
Considered by theurges versed in Wyrm lore to be
the youngest and most sophisticated of the Urge
Wyrms, Mahsstrac represents the desire for power
for its own sake. To fully come into its own, it has to
be surrounded by systems and hierarchies that can
be exploited for gain. This is why it couldn’t have
been formed until the rest of the Urge Wyrms had
already been spawned.
The Urge of Power is strengthened whenever
power becomes a means unto itself, when politicians
grasp more and more control, when intelligence
agencies break beyond their mandate to attack
domestic political enemies, and when a schoolyard
bully successfully exploits the system to make sure
weaker kids have no recourse.
