Elemental Wyrms
The basic building blocks of the
physical world are earth, fire, water, and air, at
least in the Umbra where ideas matter more
than the banal realities of atomic structure. These
elements have their counterparts in the Elemental
Wyrms, degraded and poisoned elements that
