a tendency to treat the cosmological shape of the
Umbra as eternal and unchanging. The reality
is quite different, as the spirit shadow follows
the changes that affect the physical world. This
is especially apparent in the Elemental Wyrms,
which represent quite modern types of industrial
devastation.
