The Pupkiller
A terrifying figure in modern Garou folklore, the
Pupkiller is a wolfborn Black Spiral ragabash starring
in stories each more outlandish than the last. The
Pupkiller is said to have served the Wyrm even before
his First Change, spreading sickness and death even
as an ordinary wolf. He knows when werewolf packs
are having their Rites of Passage and ambushes them,
killing them before they have a chance to become
fully fledged Garou. His spit is poison, and he’s always
