In this version, the attack is instead set in a beloved
public venue, one where the pack is among humans.
Instead of a Rite, it’s a major event like a block party.
The Dancers, brought here by the traitor, are here to
desecrate the venue and terrorize the event. The pack
must find a way to thwart them before the Dancers
start killing and Delirium turns the event into a
panicked riot.
